            new("Save player team / Save opponent", "Keep team fields, equipment and staged roster removals. Save each player's edits in their own editor.")],
        "rosters" => [
            new("Line 1 / Line 2", "Select the roster line. Prepare two-line roster opens all player-team slots without changing saved gameplay. Fill ten uniquely named skaters and a goalie before enabling Two-line roster flow and saving. That mode skips starting drafts and locks in-match lineup editing. Opponents need five Line 2 skaters when Tycoons two-line behavior is enabled."),
            new("Filled by squad setup", "The preset supplies unfilled setup positions. Stored authored players are preserved when presets or behavior controls change."),
            new("Start active", "Choose which authored skaters start on the ice. Three- and four-skater limits require an explicit valid selection before saving; unchecked players start benched and keep their files. Leave an active slot open for a starting superstar."),
            new("+ New player / + New goalie", "Create a player in the roster slot, then complete and save their fields."),
            new("Import player / Import goalie", "Copy a player into the slot without editing the source."),
            new("Edit player / Edit goalie", "Open this roster copy. Save team changes first."),
